From 824d5b1e568748032d11d9fe7f6a82e37f3e71f4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: terminills <tdeters@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 14 Jul 2026 01:50:16 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 204/638] chrome: enable desktop profile WebUI on AROS
 [chromium] [aros]

Statement:
AROS Chrome needs the portable desktop profile, App Home, and Web App settings controllers and resources used by the upstream browser UI.

Decision:
Admit AROS to the generic desktop controller and resource graph while explicitly excluding Browser Switch and the DICE/Lacros Intro flow that have no native account substrate.

Evidence:
Generated both App Home and App Settings resource packs; compiled WebAppSettingsUI, ManagedUserProfileNoticeUI, ProfileCustomizationUI, ProfilePickerUI, and ChromeWebUIControllerFactory in out/aros-chrome.

Chain:

ACD-chromium-native-port-roadmap
---
 chrome/browser/resources/BUILD.gn             |  2 +-
 .../browser/resources/app_settings/BUILD.gn   |  2 +-
 chrome/browser/ui/BUILD.gn                    | 24 ++++++++++++++++---
 .../webui/chrome_web_ui_controller_factory.cc |  2 ++
 chrome/chrome_paks.gni                        |  4 ++--
 chrome/common/webui_url_constants.cc          |  1 +
 chrome/common/webui_url_constants.h           |  1 +
 7 files changed, 29 insertions(+), 7 deletions(-)

